# The packet versions the rAthena image is built for, one per line. The first
# is the default: it is the one a fresh install plays, and the one the image is
# tagged with (ragnarokmac/rathena:<default>). Settings -> General -> Client
# version offers every line.
#
# Packetver is compiled into rAthena (./configure --enable-packetver), so each
# line here is another full build of the server in the image -- about 18 MB
# of compressed image per line. images.yml compiles each line on its own
# runner, so a line costs runner minutes rather than wall-clock time. The
# supervisor starts the binaries for the chosen one and rewrites roBrowser's `packetver` to match; the
# two cannot be chosen separately, because a client and server a packet version
# apart disagree about the size of packets and drop the connection.
#
# Only "main" (Ragexe) dates belong here. rAthena reads 2015-11-05..2018-07-03
# and 2020-09-02..2021-11-18 as RagexeRE (src/config/packets.hpp), and
# roBrowser has no RE packet tables -- which rules out rAthena's own default,
# 20211103. Anything at or before 2018-03-07 needs packet obfuscation keys and
# shuffled packet ids that roBrowser does not send.
#
#   packetver  label
20221005     default
20250402     experimental
